<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.ListSort(ListVariable: {T}, Stride: number, Ascending: boolean): {any}`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`list llListSort(list ListVariable, integer Stride, integer Ascending);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a list that is <b>src</b> sorted by <b>stride</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>{`{T}`}</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>list</span></td>
          <td>ListVariable / src</td>
          <td>List to be sorted.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Stride / stride</td>
          <td>number of entries per stride, if less than 1 it is assumed to be 1</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>boolean</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Ascending / ascending</td>
          <td>if <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a> then the sort order is ascending, otherwise the order is descending.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
